; Lives left
;
; Number of lives, 9 at the start of a game (the image holds 9). Decremented by the death routine #R$AA3D; raised by
; one, up to 9 (MAX_LIVES), by a heart (#R$A70B). The status bar draws that many hearts (#R$9BF3). When it is 0 at the
; end of the death animation the room state becomes 5, Game Over (#R$850C).
@label=Lives
g$854C DEFB $09
